# Committed on purpose: non-secret production build config. Without it the prod
# build is not reproducible from the repo — api.ts throws when
# VITE_JOB_ORDER_SUBMIT_URL is unset, so a redeploy by anyone but the last
# deployer silently breaks submit. See the header comment in the file.
!.env.production
